This package repacks the official Loongnix OpenJDK binary distribution.

Source: https://ftp.loongnix.cn/Java/openjdk17/loongson17.18.25-fx-jdk17.0.19_10-linux-loongarch64-glibc2.34.tar.gz

The JDK contents keep their upstream licenses and notices as shipped in
the source tarball under /usr/lib/jvm/loongson-17-jdk-loong64.
